{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 160,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.2808837890625,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "FQ, not only for patient selection but also to monitor the acquisition of resistance (collection of strains",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987592697143555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4397583007812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "for sequencing should be considered). Critical accompaniments to the treatment recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.392578125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "in these guidelines are access to DST for medicines for which there are reliable methods and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        393.8360290527344,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "development of other methods for newer medicines (e.g. sequencing).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4518432617188,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "ECG may be indicated because in the future, more regimens may have two or three agents that are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4002075195312,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "expected to prolong the QT interval. When QTc prolongation is identified, it is adviseable to check",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.5840454101562,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "whether the serum potassium, calcium and magnesium are abnormal (and correct if necessary).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        447.818603515625,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "Treating clinicians are also advised to obtain an ECG before initiation of treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.9987335205078,
        527.4201049804688,
        204.4417266845703
      ],
      "text": "Audiometry and specific biochemical tests should also be made available whenever certain agents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19862365722656,
        527.3893432617188,
        217.64161682128906
      ],
      "text": "are included in the regimens. Treatment in pregnancy with postpartum surveillance for congenital",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        216.3986358642578,
        527.4265747070312,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "anomalies will help to inform future recommendations for MDR/RR-TB treatment during pregnancy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.1024932861328,
        527.4003295898438,
        252.5454864501953
      ],
      "text": "It is good practice to assess patients for symptoms and signs of liver disease (e.g. fatigue, anorexia,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.30250549316406,
        527.3870849609375,
        265.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "nausea, jaundice, dark urine, liver tenderness and hepatomegaly); and to conduct laboratory tests",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.50262451171875,
        527.5416870117188,
        278.9456481933594
      ],
      "text": "such as ALT, AST, alkaline phosphatase and bilirubin. More frequent monitoring of indicators of hepatic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96484375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.70257568359375,
        326.4918518066406,
        292.1455993652344
      ],
      "text": "toxicity is strongly advised for all MDR/RR-TB regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.406494140625,
        527.1056518554688,
        313.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring changes in dosing and duration of linezolid, in particular (when needed), will be important,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96263599395752,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.60650634765625,
        527.384765625,
        327.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "to inform the future evidence base on the wider use of the 6-month or 9-month regimens, and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.8065185546875,
        260.4918212890625,
        340.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "tolerability of linezolid in these regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        347.5104064941406,
        527.5921020507812,
        361.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment administration coupled with patient support can boost adherence; it can also ensure optimal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950538635253906,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.7104187011719,
        527.4420776367188,
        375.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "drug effectiveness and safety of patients on treatment. Measures to support patient adherence (e.g.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.910400390625,
        527.4290161132812,
        388.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "facilitating patient visits to health care facilities or home visits by health care staff, or using digital",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.11041259765625,
        527.4307861328125,
        401.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "technologies for daily communication) may be important to retain patients on treatment, even when a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966650009155273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.3103942871094,
        527.1224365234375,
        414.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "regimen is comparatively short. WHO recommendations on care and support are given in Chapter 3.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98884391784668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.014404296875,
        527.2219848632812,
        436.4574279785156
      ],
      "text": "A CXR at baseline and the end of treatment can help in judging the treatment response, which should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98143482208252,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.21429443359375,
        527.386962890625,
        449.6573181152344
      ],
      "text": "be monitored by monthly sputum smear microscopy and culture (ideally at the same frequency).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.4143981933594,
        527.3217163085938,
        462.857421875
      ],
      "text": "Failure to convert sputum culture at or after the fourth month of treatment or recurrence is a potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.974320411682129,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.6144104003906,
        527.4036254882812,
        476.05743408203125
      ],
      "text": "predictor of a failing treatment regimen. Persistence of culture positivity beyond that point should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.81439208984375,
        527.4122924804688,
        489.2574157714844
      ],
      "text": "trigger DST and a potential review of the regimen. Where feasible, it is also important to follow up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.014404296875,
        527.4310302734375,
        502.4574279785156
      ],
      "text": "patients 12 months after the completion of treatment for possible relapse, including with sputum",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.21429443359375,
        527.3760375976562,
        515.6572875976562
      ],
      "text": "culture and smear. In the 2018 update of the guidelines, a separate recommendation was made on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.4144287109375,
        527.5527954101562,
        528.857421875
      ],
      "text": "the use of culture and microscopy to monitor bacteriological response during treatment. A suggested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979029655456543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        526.33837890625,
        527.5302734375,
        542.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated operational handbook on tuberculosis.  monitoring schedule is provided in the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.5383911132812,
        233.69520568847656,
        555.2573852539062
      ],
      "text": "Module 4: Treatment and care (69) .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.6076049804688,
        434.6373596191406,
        589.4876098632812
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 5.1 Monitoring patient response",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        601.1929931640625,
        200.94850158691406,
        615.5479736328125
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        622.8076171875,
        487.0883483886719,
        637.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "5.1 In multidrug- or rifampicin-resistant tuberculosis (MDR/RR-TB) patients on longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        634.9176025390625,
        511.9714050292969,
        649.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "regimens, the performance of sputum culture in addition to sputum smear microscopy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        646.9176025390625,
        339.1370849609375,
        661.360595703125
      ],
      "text": "is recommended to monitor treatment response.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        661.8934936523438,
        467.1407165527344,
        677.5574951171875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate certainty in the estimates of test accuracy)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        679.4215087890625,
        427.1404724121094,
        693.864501953125
      ],
      "text": "It is desirable for sputum culture to be repeated at monthly intervals.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "146 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
